{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EE3mF9AeNRDPQ7qqu4QpuG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SA2w5y4AnUqji1d1f55fdV","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"recursive_gen_depth_est","file":"ROADMAP.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2787,"cache_read_input_tokens":17626,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2787,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":73,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CDn82zQJAFdMpsQiadmVkm","session_id":"4ea398ee-be27-4c61-8a35-22ee8aa61ddb","uuid":"450abec3-bd86-4a9d-9258-63acdf2f74b8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SA2w5y4AnUqji1d1f55fdV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# recursive_gen_depth_est — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 14:06 UTC | 更新原因: MVP PASS, 进入 research phase, framing + plan 完成, Dream 运行中\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n递归生成深度估计：给定文本，预测其经历了多少轮 model→data→model 递归训练循环。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-14 通过，4-class acc 78.2%）\\\\n- **核心信号**: surprisal 方差 > perplexity P90 > mean perplexity 是最强深度特征\\\\n- **覆盖率**: 1/3 模型 (Pythia), 1/3 策略 (nucleus), 4/6 深度 (0-3)\\\\n- **基础设施**: westb-52439 (2× NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB)\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260514T140607 运行中，等待回调再批准 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n## Claims (详见 paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. Ordinal depth estimation feasible + accurate (DCOL method)\\\\n2. Depth Degradation Atlas (systematic characterization + EDD)\\\\n3. Depth-graduated curation > binary filtering (proof-of-concept)\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划 (详见 experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n- **P0** (45 GPU·h): 3 模型链 (Pythia/OLMo/GPT-2 XL) × 3 策略 + DCOL 训练 + leave-one-model-out + Atlas\\\\n- **P1** (38 GPU·h): leave-one-strategy-out + DeBERTa E2E + baseline battery + ablations + depth 5 + granularity\\\\n- **P2** (45 GPU·h): downstream curation + 7B probe + wild calibration\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] MVP PASS (Pythia-1.4B, 78.2% acc, 0.861 d1v2 AUC)\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md 完成\\\\n- [x] experiment_plan.yaml 完成\\\\n- [ ] Dream 模拟完成 → 审查行动项 → 批准 P0 ← 等待中\\\\n- [ ] P0 实验启动（OLMo-1B + GPT-2 XL 递归链 + Pythia 补充策略）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本项目分配: westb-52439 cuda:0, cuda:1 (2× Blackwell 98GB)\\\\n- MVP 消耗: 1.78 GPU·h\\\\n- P0 预估: 45 GPU·h (~1 day on 2 GPUs)\\\\n- P0+P1: 83 GPU·h (~2 days)\\\\n\\\\n## 教训\\\\n- Qwen2.5 预训练代码占比过高，LoRA + 无条件生成产出代码 → 换 Pythia (The Pile, 3.3% 代码)\\\\n- 手动抽查 8 条不够做域一致性判断，需 grep 定量扫描\\\\n- 指令冲突导致 Agent 来回切换模型 → 统一指令后用 replace_agent_queue 清队列\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP PASS — 递归生成深度可从统计特征高精度区分，进入 research phase | mvp_pipeline_pythia_002 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1764, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CDn82zQJAFdMpsQiadmVkm","session_id":"4ea398ee-be27-4c61-8a35-22ee8aa61ddb","uuid":"f945ca1e-f88f-4704-9417-1448dd51e7fb","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:51:55.365Z"}
